== Trivia ==
ZL 38-5 may have been specifically designed for [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Kalisa X]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]] alongside [[ZL 38]]. Ultimate Kalisa X deals massive damage against the [[Angel]] enemies, which is further amplified with her [[Explosion|Explosions]]. She is also immune to the [[Weaken]] inflected by [[Mr. Angel]], [[LeMurr]], [[Great Angel Chibinel]], and [[Winged Pigge]] as well as the [[Wave Attack|Wave Attacks]] from [[Bun Bun Symbiote]].  

